CORE broken-smt-backend
main.c
--no-standard-checks
^EXIT=0$
^SIGNAL=0$
^VERIFICATION SUCCESSFUL$
--
^warning: ignoring
--
Constant shift distances of 2^31 or more must shift out all bits. The SMT2
back end truncates shift distances that are wider than the shifted operand,
which https://github.com/diffblue/cbmc/pull/9178 addresses.
